Package: libpango1.0-dev
Version: @DEB_LIBPANGO_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.pango.org/
Depends: libpango-1.0-0 (= @DEB_LIBPANGO_V@), libglib2.0-dev, libcairo2-dev, libharfbuzz-dev, libfribidi-dev, libfontconfig-dev, libfreetype-dev
Description: Development files for the Pango text layout library
 Pango is a library for laying out and rendering of text, with an emphasis on
 internationalization.
 .
 This package contains the development headers, static libraries and
 pkg-config files needed to build software that uses Pango.
